title: No Brains on Tuesday
summary: Keith's 1991 sequel to 'No Brains At All', collecting the columns he wrote for the Age and Sydney Morning Herald after leaving the Sun News-Pictorial in 1985, on eating, drinking, domestic life, cricket and the agonies of creating a vineyard.
---
<p class="lead">Published in 1991, 'No Brains on Tuesday' collects the columns Keith Dunstan wrote for the Age and Sydney Morning Herald after 34 years at the Sun News-Pictorial, a small sequel to his 1990 autobiography 'No Brains At All'.</p>
<hr>
