  <div class="col-12 col-md-9">
    <h3 class="h5">Foreword</h3>
    <p>Michael Smith, editor of the Age, introduces the collection: 'None of this is to under-estimate the power of Dunstan's journalism. He has been Melbourne's best-read columnist for more than 30 years.'</p>
  </div>
</div>
